  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the sweet potato, carrot and beetroot into small chunks. Cut the brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Divide the sweet potato, carrot, beetroot and onion between two lined oven trays. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then spread out in a single layer and roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6152b25cfa048e5eb47b5513/step-e67b0e57.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, pat the haloumi dry, then slice horizontally to get one thin piece per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6152b25cfa048e5eb47b5513/step-8202d682.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and Nan's special seasoning. Add the haloumi and season with pepper. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6152b25cfa048e5eb47b5513/step-09c42e7b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi until browned, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6152b25cfa048e5eb47b5513/step-80828468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine the roasted veggies and spinach & rocket mix. Season.\n• TIP: Toss the veggies on one of the roasting trays to save washing up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6152b25cfa048e5eb47b5513/step-49439f70.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the haloumi. Divide the roast veggie toss and Nan's haloumi between plates. Sprinkle with the flaked almonds and drizzle with the creamy pesto dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6152b25cfa048e5eb47b5513/step-2e4c858c.jpg"
    }
  ]
